    },
    "description": "Mark one checklist item as obtained or not — the tool for 'my passport is done', 'I still need the transcript'. Needs a document_id from documents_list; that id is a short template key like 'passport', NOT a database id. Set completed true when the user has the document in hand. notes and expiry_date REPLACE what is stored, so omit them to leave them alone. expiry_date is YYYY-MM-DD and matters for documents that lapse (passport, police record, medical check).",
    "inputSchema": {
