    "description": "Replace the user's checklist with the ready-made list for one country — use it for 'set up my documents for Japan' or when documents_list returned null. country is the ISO-3166-1 alpha-2 code from documents_list_countries ('ID', 'JP', 'DE'). Items the user had already ticked off keep their completed flag, notes and expiry when the same document_id exists in the new list; anything not in the new list is dropped, so confirm with the user before switching an established checklist to a different country.",
