    "description": "Add one portfolio entry — a project, certification, talk, publication, award. title, description, category and date are required. category MUST be one of the listed values, spelled exactly ('openSource' is camelCase); use 'other' rather than inventing one. date is free text but write it as YYYY-MM or YYYY so entries sort sensibly. link is the single main URL (repo, live site, certificate); it does not carry images — attach those with portfolio_set_media after creating the entry. featured pins the entry to the top of the grid and to the user's public page — leave it off unless they ask.",
